From: Gnoblin <gnoblin@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Render explicit standard background regions

Render the full region, including holes, disjoint rectangles and fully
transparent client pixels. Keep fade composition and the legacy alpha mask.
Use matching texture coordinates for the backdrop and foreground mask in
every region rectangle; default per-rectangle coordinates corrupt detail.

